ked-solution "Speed is a special unit rate applied to moving objects. It is defined as *the distance traveled per unit of time*:\n\n$$\n\\text{speed}=\\frac{\\text{distance}}{\\text{time}}\n$$\n\nTo find the speed in centimeters per minute, we divide the number of centimeters, $135,$ by the number of minutes, $30.$ This gives,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{135}{30} & =135÷30 \\\\  & =\\frac{135÷15}{30÷15} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2} \\\\  & =9÷2 \\\\  & =4.5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the speed of the slug is $4.5$ centimeters per minute. \n\nTo find the distance covered in $18$ minutes, we multiply the speed by $18.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{distance} & =\\text{speed}\\times \\text{time} \\\\  & =4.5\\times 18 \\\\  & =81.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slug covers $81$ centimeters in $18$ minutes." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-134243/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "534de76f-d4bc-55b5-858e-2b594f63b7bc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-134243"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-134176/selection/1cabdd3c88f60cf67ba3ba388f310f41a831fb461028b3886381be63e027b025" :answer/id #uuid "e2ec7ec8-2177-53f8-acbe-c4dd437c16b6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$234$ kilometers" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134176/selection/3ea4baf0405e01eae88fced652c4470b492024c65bb5ffb2616f97ef0c4fd695" :answer/id #uuid "10b8667a-be8f-50b3-930d-e02bddd3e0a7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1.25$ kilometers" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134176/selection/09f0e5f1ac0f2ce00e1ada6568b8c5d7221d25033e86b731ec077a49061cbeea" :answer/id #uuid "89232b85-5472-5b76-b568-ac6f82737f8e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$180$ kilometers" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134176/selection/22760ee8780a5b76967b2e28ab4caffdcf08cd9bf7588da46fdd9dd6d51ee7a1" :answer/id #uuid "ac22e1b6-4207-5b5b-85c8-f2dfab413672" :a