\frac{63}{7} \\\\  & =63÷7 \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the speed of the dolphin is $9$ meters per second. \n\nTo find the time it takes the dolphin to cover $396$ meters, we divide the distance by $9.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{time} & =\\frac{\\text{distance}}{\\text{speed}} \\\\  & =\\frac{396}{9} \\\\  & =396÷9 \\\\  & =44.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, it takes the dolphin $44$ seconds to travel $396$ meters." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-134241/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6570253a-b05a-5721-9108-5fddab2b5388"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-134241"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-134239/selection/11ade170bf6734c8261d355da5201b45884bee8397f8289676c5b17174e75d57" :answer/id #uuid "981e3067-84fd-54a6-ada9-0376bee28129" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2$ hours" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134239/selection/d4754135edcad932601c158ec44b427c9f68d56f6a845bd6641b2d3dd5b54771" :answer/id #uuid "a5129a53-b64a-5a3e-96bb-2182b5be4d8e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$0.2$ hours" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134239/selection/c18efd2aadcb0f9eed4017606d63505e6f20fc260de764f4c2deaa3dfb1d16cd" :answer/id #uuid "ed783f89-6219-56b4-bade-4c5d22f2eb3b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$0.75$ hours" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134239/selection/1f2d0a1c208208d6af225236aaba6f455c693cbc858a5da74123041cf6648ecc" :answer/id #uuid "025ba28b-d7b5-59ff-b3dd-c7ea7680b7b2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$0.5$ hours" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134239/selection/ba30cd932af554726485670bf3be1ac24be24da6e899085ae3f426d3e3c361ef" :answer/id #uuid "7e0f29e6-1fe7-59ed-8a65-0d7b1e0cd552" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$ hour" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-134239/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "305b515d-5ee0-5727-bc